WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.115
"I'm so sorry, Bird!" said Kip.

2
00:00:13.116 --> 00:00:17.680
"I guess it's okay," said Bird.

3
00:00:17.681 --> 00:00:20.301
"I can fix my nest."

4
00:00:20.302 --> 00:00:22.261
"No," said Kip.

5
00:00:22.262 --> 00:00:25.873
" We can fix your

6
00:00:25.874 --> 00:00:32.910
nest. Let's look for some new

7
00:00:32.911 --> 00:00:39.193
sticks." Bird and Kip looked for new

8
00:00:39.194 --> 00:00:53.870
sticks. They found some in the

9
00:00:53.871 --> 00:01:17.133
park. They found some on the

10
00:01:17.134 --> 00:01:19.973
boardwalk. Then Kip found a fancy

11
00:01:19.974 --> 00:01:23.406
stick. And it was in a

12
00:01:23.407 --> 00:01:25.851
car! "Vroom!" said

13
00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:29.650
Kip. "What are you doing?" asked Bird.

14
00:01:29.651 --> 00:01:32.891
"I'm a race car driver!" said Kip.

15
00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.744
"Don't be silly," said Bird.

16
00:01:35.745 --> 00:01:38.292
"You're not a race car driver."

17
00:01:38.293 --> 00:01:40.952
"Come on, Bird," said Kip.

18
00:01:40.953 --> 00:01:43.357
"Let's go for a ride!"

19
00:01:43.358 --> 00:01:47.890
"I don't want to ride in a car," said Bird.

20
00:01:47.891 --> 00:01:50.572
"Cars go too fast."

21
00:01:50.573 --> 00:01:54.373
"But we're just pretending," said Kip.

22
00:01:54.374 --> 00:01:57.888
"Oh, okay," said Bird.

23
00:01:57.889 --> 00:01:59.987
"Why not?"

24
00:01:59.988 --> 00:02:04.743
Bird climbed into the car.

25
00:02:04.744 --> 00:02:12.347
Suddenly it started to move!

